Once this scaffold is in place:
1. `npm install`, then `npm run build` to confirm it compiles cleanly.
2. Implement tools in `src/tools/*.ts`, starting with read-only ones (`list_bases`, `list_records`) before destructive ones (`create/update/delete_record`).
